[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0093","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0228","title":"GoAhead Web Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"GoAhead WebServer 2.1 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，仅通过向目标服务器发送包含 `../` 序列的特制 HTTP GET 请求，即可绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于服务器对用户请求路径过滤不严，未能正确规范化 `../` 等目录回溯序列，导致攻击者可遍历至 Web 根目录以外的敏感文件（如 `/etc/passwd`、配置文件等），造成信息泄露。攻击条件简单，无需特殊权限即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0228"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:55Z","remediation":"The user wants me to generate a [remediation] field for CVE-2001-0228. This is a directory traversal vulnerability in GoAhead web server 2.1 and earlier. Let me provide a specific, actionable remediation suggestion in Chinese.\n\nGoAhead WebServer is an embedded web server. For such an old vulnerability (2001), the affected version is 2.1 and earlier. The remediation should recommend upgrading to a version that fixes the issue, or implementing a WAF rule / input validation as mitigation.\n\nGoAhead web server 2.1.0 and earlier are vulnerable. The fix would be to upgrade to GoAhead 2.1.1 or later, or apply input filtering for \"..\" sequences.\n\nLet me provide a concrete remediation.<value>升级 GoAhead WebServer 至 2.1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复路径遍历问题。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截包含 \"../\" 或 \"..\\\" 序列的 HTTP GET 请求，同时对 URL 中的路径参数进行规范化校验。\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0022.html","http://freecode.com/projects/embedthis-goahead-webserver/releases/343539","http://osvdb.org/81099","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20607","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0228.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0228.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0228","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0228.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vc5x-9m2r-pv7f/GHSA-vc5x-9m2r-pv7f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88638/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0228.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148700_148800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0080","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0205","title":"AOLserver 3.2 目录遍历漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0205是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0205"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"AOLserver 3.2 及更早版本未对路径中的连续三个点（...）进行安全检查，攻击者可利用该漏洞遍历目录读取敏感文件。建议立即升级至 AOLserver 3.5.1 或更高版本（4.0 GM 及以上），后续版本已修复对多连续点的路径校验逻辑。若短期内无法升级，可在前置反向代理（如 Nginx）中配置正则匹配拒绝包含连续三个点的请求路径，或在防火墙层面拦截包含 \"...\" 的 HTTP 请求 URI，作为临时缓解措施。同时应检查 Web 根目录权限，确保敏感配置文件（如 nsd.conf、数据库连接文件）不在 Web 可访问路径下，限制 AOLserver 进程对系统目录的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98148759123258&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98168216003867&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2343","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20614","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0205.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0205.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0205","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0205.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0205.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0205.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f89e5c809343acea555b12ff38461dcb4bd93eb9/2001/CVE-2001-0205.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/22b1a4be43e1ee76195d2510f5edf079a15013bd/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0205.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0205.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0205.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0080.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0080.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0079","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0202","title":"Informs Picserver 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Picserver 1.0 存在路径遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP GET 请求中使用 .. (dot dot) 路径遍历序列，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件。该漏洞影响 Informs Picserver 1.0 Web 服务器，攻击者无需预先认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低且易于实施，可导致服务器配置文件、系统文件等敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0202"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"由于Informs Picserver 1.0年代久远且厂商已无维护记录，建议将Web服务器迁移至受支持的替代产品（如Nginx或Apache HTTP Server最新稳定版）。如短期内无法替换，应在反向代理或WAF层面对HTTP GET请求路径进行过滤，拦截包含\"../\"或\"..\\\\\"的目录遍历特征；同时限制Picserver运行账户对服务器文件系统的访问权限，仅开放Web根目录所需的最小读取范围，并监控异常文件访问行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0073.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2339","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20612","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0202.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0202.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0202","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0202.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0202.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0202.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2001/CVE-2001-0202.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0202.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0202.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0202.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0078","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0200","title":"Heat-On HSWeb Web Server 路径泄露漏洞","description":"Heat-On HSWeb Web Server 2.0 存在信息泄露漏洞，当服务器启用目录浏览功能时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标服务器发送针对 /cgi/ 目录的HTTP请求，即可在页面响应中获取服务器的物理文件路径。该漏洞影响所有运行 Heat-On HSWeb 2.0 版本的Web服务器，攻击条件为目标服务器开启了目录浏览功能且攻击者能够访问其HTTP服务。泄露的物理路径信息可辅助攻击者进一步了解服务器文件系统结构，为后续渗透攻击（如本地文件包含、敏感文件定位等）提供便利，存在潜在的安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0200"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"如已升级至更新版本请确保目录浏览功能已被禁用；如仍运行该版本，应在服务器配置中关闭目录索引（Directory Indexing）功能，并移除或限制对 `/cgi/` 目录的访问权限。若厂商已发布补丁，请立即升级至最新版本；因该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器。临时缓解措施可在防火墙或反向代理层拦截对 `/cgi/` 路径的访问请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0052.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2336","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20609","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0200","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2001/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0200.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0078.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0078.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0077","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0199","title":"SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，该服务器未对 HTTP GET 请求中的文件路径进行充分过滤和校验，导致远程攻击者可通过在请求路径中插入 .. (dot dot) 序列实现目录穿越，从而读取服务器文件系统上的任意敏感文件。该漏洞影响范围为运行 SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 的所有系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，攻击条件为能够向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求，利用方式为构造包含多层 ../ 路径穿越序列的请求，即可突破 Web 根目录限制访问系统配置文件、密码文件或其他敏感数据，造成信息泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0199"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"建议将 SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 替换为 Apache、Nginx 等仍受支持的现代 HTTP 服务器；如确需临时继续使用，应在服务器配置中严格过滤 URL 中的 ../ 和 .../ 序列，限制 Web 根目录外的文件访问权限，并在防火墙或反向代理层禁止外部直接访问服务器端口，仅允许通过前端代理转发请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0064.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/651994","http://www.osvdb.org/14797","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2335","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6063","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20608","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0199","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2001/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0199.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0199.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0076","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0198","title":"Apple QuickTime Player 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime Player 4.1.2（日文版）浏览器插件在处理网页中的 EMBED 标签时，若 HREF 参数长度过长则触发缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含特制 HREF 参数的恶意网页，诱使目标用户访问后即可在用户系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 Windows 系统的 QuickTime Player 4.1.2（日文版）用户，攻击者需要诱导用户用浏览器打开包含恶意 EMBED 标签的网页才能利用成功，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高危。攻击者成功利用后可完全控制用户系统，窃取敏感数据或进一步横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0198"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载 Apple QuickTime for Windows（苹果已于 2016 年停止支持并不再提供安全更新），改用 VLC Media Player 或 MPC-HC 等现代播放器替代。若业务强依赖 QuickTime，可升级至 QuickTime 7.7.9（Windows 最后一个版本，官网已下架，需从可信镜像站获取），并在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件（IE：Internet 选项 → 程序 → 管理加载项 → 禁用 QuickTime Plug-in；Chrome/Firefox：地址栏输入 about:addons 禁用相关插件）。临时缓解：在防火墙层面阻断来自非信任站点的 .mov/.qt 文件下载，或部署网络层 IPS 规则拦截包含超长 HREF 参数的 EMBED 标签流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98096678523370&w=2","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20605","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2328","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6040","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20605","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0198.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0198.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0198","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0198.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0198.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2001/CVE-2001-0198.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0198.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0198.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0198.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0198.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0076.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0076.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0074","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0193","title":"Linux man 命令格式字符串漏洞","description":"man 命令存在格式字符串漏洞，由于处理 -l 参数时未对用户输入进行 adequate 验证，本地低权限用户可通过向 man 命令传递特制的格式字符串，利用栈上的内存地址写入覆盖函数返回地址，从而在栈上执行任意代码。由于多个 Linux 发行版中的 man 程序以 SUID root 权限安装，攻击者成功利用后可获得 root 权限，完全控制系统。该漏洞影响 Debian 2.2 以及 S.u.S.E 6.3、6.4、7.0 等版本，攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地登录权限，利用方式为通过构造包含格式化说明符的 -l 参数触发格式化字符串漏洞，进而执行提权代码获取管理员权限。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0193"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51Z","remediation":"建议升级到包含 man 命令安全补丁的发行版，如升级到 Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 及以上版本、Debian 10 及以上版本，或从相应的 Linux 发行版供应商处获取 man 命令的安全更新。如无法立即升级，可立即将 /usr/bin/man 文件的 SUID 权限移除（chmod 755 /usr/bin/man），并避免在 shell 中直接使用 man -l 选项进行手册查询，如确需使用应预先验证输入参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98096782126481&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-028","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2327","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6059","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20604","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0193","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c2d7976a30d9a4bb0d098cbb553bce11e610b2f4/2001/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0193.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0193.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0073","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0192","title":"Xmail CTRLServer 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"XMail 邮件服务器中的 CTRLServer 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标发送特制请求，利用 cfgfileget 或 domaindel 函数触发缓冲区溢出，进而在系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 XMail 0.5 和 0.6 版本，攻击者可借此完全控制受影响服务器，CVSS 评分满分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0192"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Xmail 0.5/0.6 版本并迁移至现代、安全的邮件服务器软件。若必须维持运行，应在防火墙中严格限制 CTRLServer 端口的访问权限，仅允许受信 IP 访问，或直接禁用该管理服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0047.html","http://xmailserver.org/XMail-Readme.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20622","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0192","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2001/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0192.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0192.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0067","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0173","title":"qDecoder 库 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"qDecoder 4.x/5.x 库存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。该库广泛应用于 CrazyWWWBoard、CrazySearch 及其他 CGI 程序中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过向目标 CGI 程序发送特制的 HTTP 请求，其中 MIME Content-Type 头部字段包含超长字符串，从而触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意远程命令。该漏洞攻击条件极低，仅需网络访问即可触发，无需用户交互或认证。攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制受影响服务器，导致机密性、完整性和可用性全部受损， CVSS 评分为 10.0（严重）。漏洞影响范围包括所有使用 qDecoder 5.08 及更早版本的基于 CGI 的 Web 应用程序。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0173"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48Z","remediation":"请立即升级到 qDecoder 5.0.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Content-Type 头部缓冲区溢出漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层配置规则，限制 HTTP 请求中 Content-Type 头部的最大长度为 254 字符以下，并拒绝包含异常长字符串的请求，以阻断远程代码执行攻击。同时建议审查所有基于 qDecoder 的 CGI 程序（如 CrazyWWWBoard、CrazySearch）并替换为已修复版本的库文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0486.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2329","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6033","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20606","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0173","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f6551b9664b7c57bdc824f681a941c2766269db/2001/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0173.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0173.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0067.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0067.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0065","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0171","title":"WhitSoft SlimServe HTTPd 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WhitSoft SlimServe HTTPd 1.0 及 1.1 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求触发该溢出，导致服务拒绝，并可能进一步执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响所有运行 SlimServe HTTPd 1.0/1.1 的 Windows 服务器，攻击者无需任何凭据或特殊权限，在网络可达的情况下即可利用此漏洞发起攻击，攻击条件简单且危害极大，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0171"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到更新的 HTTP 服务器软件（如 Apache、Nginx 或 IIS），WhitSoft SlimServe 已停止维护且无官方补丁。如暂无法替换，应在防火墙或反向代理层配置规则，限制 HTTP GET 请求行长度不超过 8192 字节以阻止超长请求触发的缓冲区溢出；同时限制来自单一源 IP 的并发连接数作为临时缓解措施，并尽快安排迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0505.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2318","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6028","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20662","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0171","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c229a4a30cc18f066e828fa99f8fa314a2da50ed/2001/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0171.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0171.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0065.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0062","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0168","title":"AT&T WinVNC HTTP GET 请求缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0168是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0168"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:47Z","remediation":"立即将 WinVNC 升级至官方发布的安全版本，并手工修改 vnc_winsrc/winvnc/Log.cpp 文件，将第 133 行的 vsprintf(line, format, ap) 替换为 _vsnprintf(line, sizeof(line)-sizeof(TCHAR), format, ap)，重新编译部署。若无法立即升级，应将注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\ORL\\WinVNC3\\DebugLevel 的值设为 0 以关闭调试日志功能，并在防火墙规则中阻断 5800/tcp 和 5900/tcp 端口的公网访问。官方补丁文件可从 ftp://ftp.core-sdi.com/pub/patches/VNC-serverBO.patch 获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=vnc-list&m=98080763005455&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/598581","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2306","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6026","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16491","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0168.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0168.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0168","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0168.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0168.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/52862ce9daccf736821f20dad3f82fea401e5f1e/2001/CVE-2001-0168.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0168.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0168.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/7b0091a6728c321d97febad01bf502be7a113020/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0168.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0061","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0167","title":"AT&T WinVNC 客户端缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AT&T WinVNC（Virtual Network Computing）客户端 3.3.3r7 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可搭建恶意 VNC 服务器，当目标客户端连接该服务器时，服务器发送特制的 RFB 协议连接失败数据包（rfbConnFailed），并在其中携带超长的原因字符串（reason string）。客户端在处理该数据包时未对字符串长度进行充分边界检查，导致栈缓冲区溢出。成功利用该漏洞可在目标系统上执行任意代码，且无需身份认证。该漏洞影响 RealVNC 3.3.7 及以下版本，攻击条件要求目标客户端主动连接到攻击者控制的恶意 VNC 服务器，利用复杂度较高但危害严重，可完全破坏目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0167"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:47Z","remediation":"升级到 RealVNC/WinVNC 3.3.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `_vstprintf` 调用中未限制缓冲区长度的缺陷。对于无法立即升级的系统，可临时采取以下缓解措施：在防火墙中限制对 VNC 客户端发起主动连接的外部 IP，避免客户端连接到不可信服务器；或修改源码中 `vncviewer/vnc_winsrc/Log.cpp` 文件，将 `_vstprintf(line, format, ap)` 替换为 `_vsntprintf(line, sizeof(line) - sizeof(TCHAR), format, ap)` 以限制字符串写入长度，重新编译后部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98088315825366&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2305","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6025","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16489","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0167.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0167.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0167.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0167","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2001/CVE-2001-0167.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0167.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0167.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0167.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0167.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2001/CVE-2001-0167.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0060","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0165","title":"Sun Solaris 7/8 ximp40 共享库缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0165是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0165"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:47Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 2001 年推荐补丁集（Recommended Patch Cluster）或升级至 Solaris 9/10，补丁已修复 ximp40.so.2 库中的 arg0 参数缓冲区溢出。如无法立即打补丁，可对受影响程序移除 SUID/SGID 权限位作为临时缓解措施：chmod u-s /usr/dt/bin/dtaction /usr/dt/bin/dtprintinfo /usr/openwin/bin/sys-suspend /usr/dt/bin/dtappgather /usr/bin/admintool && chmod g-s /usr/dt/bin/dtmail /usr/openwin/bin/mailtool，防止本地用户利用长进程名参数获取 root 或 mail 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0517.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2322","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6039","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20603","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0165.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0165.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0165","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0165.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0165.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/25203fd38febf163b5a0afeecde6a3effc609cec/2001/CVE-2001-0165.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0165.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0165.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0165.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0165.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0141","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0141.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0317","title":"Linux Kernel 2.2.18 ptrace/execve 竞争条件权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.18（RedHat 7.0/6.2 / 2.2.14 / 2.2.18 / 2.2.18ow4）ptrace/execve 系统调用之间的进程同步竞争导致漏洞，该漏洞利用内核在父子进程内存空间创建过程中的时间窗，在未经授权的情况下实现进程间权限提升。该漏洞影响多版本内核及红帽企业版系统，攻击者需触发 ptrace 系统调用的特殊序列，与 execve 系统调用竞争关键的内核资源状态，成功后即获得更高权限访问控制。该漏洞的危害等级严重，可能导致攻击者完全控制目标主机。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0317"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-05-03T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20721","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0317.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0317","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f0